SecRuleInheritance Off
SecRuleEngine On
SecRulePerfTime 3000
SecConnEngine On
SecContentInjection On 

SecChrootDir /
SecTmpDir /tmp
SecDataDir /tmp

SecAuditEngine Off
SecAuditLogParts ABIHZ
SecAuditLogType Concurrent
SecAuditLogRelevantStatus "^(?:5|4(?!04))"
SecAuditLogDirMode 0750
SecAuditLogFileMode 0640

SecUnicodeCodePage 20127
SecCacheTransformations Off
SecDisableBackendCompression Off
SecHashEngine Off
SecHashKey rand KeyOnly
SecHashParam "hmac"
SecUploadKeepFiles Off
SecTmpSaveUploadedFiles On
SecArgumentSeparator &
SecCookieFormat 0
SecCookieV0Separator ;
SecUploadFileMode 0600
SecUploadFileLimit 100
SecPcreMatchLimit 10000
SecPcreMatchLimitRecursion 10000

SecRequestBodyAccess On
SecRequestBodyLimitAction Reject
SecRequestBodyInMemoryLimit 131072
SecRequestBodyJsonDepthLimit 512

SecResponseBodyAccess On
SecResponseBodyMimeTypesClear
SecResponseBodyMimeType text/html text/plain text/xml
SecResponseBodyLimitAction ProcessPartial
SecStatusEngine Off
SecStreamInBodyInspection Off
SecStreamOutBodyInspection Off
SecInterceptOnError On
SecSensorId CGWAF
SecXmlExternalEntity Off
